Page 1-line 4 After "consultants;" insert "providing funding for an
external cost adjustment to the education resource
block grant model;".
Page 5-after line 2 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"Section 3.
(a) There is appropriated from the public school foundation program
account to the department of education-school finance thirty-eight million five
hundred thousand dollars ($38,500,000.00) for an external cost adjustment to
the education resource block grant model in accordance with this section. If
2025 Senate File 0001 or 2025 House Bill 0001 is enacted into law, the
appropriation in this subsection shall be reduced by one dollar ($1.00) for
every one dollar ($1.00) appropriated to the department of education-school

finance for an external cost adjustment to the education resource block grant
model in 2025 Senate File 0001 or 2025 House Bill 0001.
(b) In accordance with W.S. 21-13-309(o), the appropriation in subsection
(a) of this section provides funding for an external cost adjustment to the
education resource block grant model, effective beginning with school year 2025-
2026, computed as follows:
(i) Except as provided in paragraph (v) of this subsection, four
and seven hundred sixty-one thousandths percent (4.761%) for the "professional
labor" category of model components inclusive of those components defined by
2012 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 99, Section 3 [Attachment "A"(a)(vi)];
(ii) Five and forty-one hundredths percent (5.41%) for the
"nonprofessional labor" category of model components inclusive of those
components defined by 2012 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 99, Section 3
[Attachment "A"(a)(v)];
(iii) One and sixty-seven thousandths percent (1.067%) for the
"educational materials" category of model components inclusive of those
components defined by 2012 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 99, Section 3
[Attachment "A"(a)(iii)];
(iv) Negative six and two hundred eighty-five thousandths percent
(-6.285%) for the "energy" category of model components inclusive of those
components defined by 2012 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 99, Section 3
[Attachment "A"(a)(iv)];
(v) Six and seventy-eight hundredths percent (6.78%) to the teacher
salaries component as defined by 2011 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 185,
[Attachment "A"(b)(xxxvii)]. For purposes of this paragraph and in accordance
with 2011 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 185, [Attachment "A"(b)(xxxvii)],
"teachers" include core and specialist teachers, instructional facilitators,
tutors, ELL teachers, extended day teachers, summer school teachers, pupil
support staff, secondary school guidance counselors and librarians.
(c) The appropriation in subsection (a) of this section shall be for the
period beginning July 1, 2025 and ending June 30, 2026. The appropriation in
subsection (a) of this section shall not be transferred or expended for any
other purpose and any unexpended, unobligated funds remaining from this
appropriation shall revert as provided by law on June 30, 2026. It is the intent
of the legislature that the appropriation in subsection (a) of this section be
doubled and be included in the department of education-school finance's standard
budget for the immediately succeeding fiscal biennium.".
